+# Pulseboard
+
+> Pulseboard helps team facilitators turn a weekly meeting transcript into proposed follow-up actions without allowing unreviewed automation. A facilitator uploads a transcript, reviews each proposed action, and confirms its owner and due date before any reminder can be scheduled. The product is bounded to post-meeting action follow-through for a five-team pilot; it does not record meetings, replace calendars, or send messages autonomously.
